      {
        "author_name": "Eric Bourguet",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113282871757091009755/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKAlQ2UNyqn7xFlN488ZHlGVZyNdrl1ldpKh_dj3l_7ZRgWIg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Overall, our trip to Panama went well, but as for the \"promise\" of a sunny trip, it was a failure! We told my wife that yes, August is perfect! Beautiful weather, heat, etc.... Well no! August is almost winter for them and the rainy season is just around the corner! So, we arrived in the rain, 24 degrees Celsius and thunderstorms were forecast throughout our stay! We had 3 days of good weather out of 7...Wow. 🙄🙄. For expedition reservations, book on site! With Sunwing, it would have been cheaper than the travel agency...🤔😑. NEVER lie to your clients! Especially not to NEW clients! They are not stupid and there is no shortage of travel agencies! Next time, you can be sure that we will look elsewhere...",
